| <ab>{{tt|밤하늘 밝게 빛나는 수많은 별들 속에|Bamhaneul balge bitnaneun sumaneun byeoldeul seoge}}
{{tt|소중한 나의 꿈을 새겨 놓고서|Sojunghan na-ui kkumeul saegyeo nokoseo}}
{{tt|두근거리는 맘으로 빛나는 아침과 함께|Dugeungeorineun mameuro bitnaneun achimgwa hamkke}}
{{tt|새롭고 신기한 모험 속으로|Saerobgo singihan moheom seogeuro}}

{{tt|비밀을 간직한 길을 지나|Bimireul ganjikhan gireil jina}}
{{tt|또 다른 위험을 피해 달려가|Tto dareun wiheomeul pihae dallyeoga}}
{{tt|특별한 기적이 우릴 기다려|Teukbyeolhan gijeogi uril gidaryeo}}

{{tt|오늘은 시합에선 적으로 만났지만|Oneuleun sihabeseon jeogeuro mannatjiman}}
{{tt|내일의 태양아래 다시 만나면|Nae-ilui taeyangarae dasi mannamyeon}}
{{tt|우리는 모두 친구가 될거야|Urineun modu chinguga doelgeoya}}

{{tt|혹시 길을 잃어도 두려워하지는 마|Hoksi gireil ileodo duryeowohajineun ma}}
{{tt|마음의 지도로 보면 찾을 수 있어|Ma-eumui jidoro bomyeon chajeul su isso}}
{{tt|내일로 향하는 더 멋진 길을|Nae-illo hyanghaneun deo meotjin gireul}}
{{tt|그러니 웃어봐|Geureoni useobwa}}
{{tt|환하게, 더 환하게|Hwanhage, deo hwanhage}}</ab>
| <ab>''Amongst the numerous stars that brightly light up the night sky
I inscribe my precious dream
With an expectant heart and a shining morning 
I head into a new and mysterious adventure

Passing by the road of secrets,
Running to avoid another danger
A special miracle awaits us

Even though I met you as an opponent during today’s battle
If we meet again under tomorrow’s sun
We will all become friends

Don’t be afraid if you lose the way
If you look at your heart’s map, you can find
A better road heading towards tomorrow
So smile
Brightly, more brightly''</ab>
|}
